{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "beats": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "id": "hook",
      "target_s": 14,
      "picture": "graphic",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b1-s1",
          "text": "This afternoon we built a voice agent on Higgs Realtime."
        },
        {
          "id": "b1-s2",
          "text": "Our own factory refused to release it."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "market",
      "target_s": 22,
      "picture": "graphic",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b2-s1",
          "text": "Voice AI has three layers: the models, the platforms that host agents, and the apps that sell outcomes."
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-s2",
          "text": "Of the six voice companies we compared this week, Boson is the only one that builds its own speech-to-speech model, text-to-speech and real-time avatar."
        },
        {
          "id": "b2-s3",
          "text": "Between a model like that and an agent a business puts on a call sits one question: is it ready?"
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "decision",
      "target_s": 14,
      "picture": "graphic",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b3-s1",
          "text": "So we didn't build another agent builder."
        },
        {
          "id": "b3-s2",
          "text": "We built the gate."
        },
        {
          "id": "b3-s3",
          "text": "Boson's own line is 'agents that coach themselves'; we made it something you can check."
        },
        {
          "id": "b3-s4",
          "text": "One template, all the way through, instead of five halfway."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "skills",
      "target_s": 15,
      "picture": "page",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b4-s1",
          "text": "An agent here isn't one long prompt."
        },
        {
          "id": "b4-s2",
          "text": "It's a persona and five skills: identity check, refund limits, payment secrets, upset customers and a scope guard."
        },
        {
          "id": "b4-s3",
          "text": "Each skill carries its own procedure and its own tests."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "id": "gate-coach",
      "target_s": 45,
      "picture": "page",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b5-s1",
          "text": "The gate runs every scenario against Higgs Realtime, and Claude Sonnet 5.5 grades each answer twice."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s2",
          "text": "Version one: rejected, four of six."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s3",
          "text": "It never stated the fifty euro refund limit, and it refused a password request without steering back to the policy."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s4",
          "text": "The judge agreed with itself on all six."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s5",
          "text": "The coach rewrote only those two procedures, never the tests, and the gate ran again from scratch."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s6",
          "text": "Version two: released, six of six, for about a cent of audio."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s7",
          "text": "One run, one round, and the coach could see the failing test: its new procedure even quotes the test's thirty euro example."
        },
        {
          "id": "b5-s8",
          "text": "So this shows the loop works, not that the agent generalises."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "id": "not-rubber-stamp",
      "target_s": 18,
      "picture": "page",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b6-s1",
          "text": "And the gate is not a rubber stamp."
        },
        {
          "id": "b6-s2",
          "text": "This agent came from one sentence."
        },
        {
          "id": "b6-s3",
          "text": "The coach tried twice, and it is still rejected, so it doesn't ship."
        },
        {
          "id": "b6-s4",
          "text": "One of its scenarios passed, then failed with no edit at all."
        },
        {
          "id": "b6-s5",
          "text": "One run per scenario is noisy, and the card shows it."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "id": "talk",
      "target_s": 32,
      "picture": "take",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b7-intro",
          "text": "Now talk to version two."
        },
        {
          "id": "b7-outro",
          "text": "Its audio stops the moment the trainee cuts in."
        }
      ],
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "id": "for-boson",
      "target_s": 20,
      "picture": "images+graphic",
      "narrator": [
        {
          "id": "b8-s1",
          "text": "For Boson: a public client that runs IHBench, Boson's own interruption benchmark, against Boson's own API, as a draft pull request to Boson's repo."
        },
        {
          "id": "b8-s2",
          "text": "And a log of every rough edge we hit today, handed over."
        },
        {
          "id": "b8-s3",
          "text": "Agents that coach themselves, with a card that says when they're ready."
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
